meta {
  name: RunSetupStep
  type: http
  seq: 4
}

post {
  url: {{url}}admin/setup/run
  body: json
  auth: inherit
}

body:json {
  { "keys": ["elb1871-text"] }
}

docs {
  Admin only (roadmap 0031.6). Runs the named setup steps as one background seed job (operation "setup", kind = the key) and answers 202 with the job; poll GET admin/setup (job + counts) or GET maintainer/seed/status. Body: exactly one of keys, group or all. 400 "not red" when a step is green (or amber and not resumable), 400 when it is not wired or waits on a step that is not green, 409 while any seed job or export runs. A failing step ends the job failed and the step stays red (failed: true). Try: run elb1871-text -> 202, repeat -> 400 not red, run elb1871-verses before the text -> 400 needs elb1871-text first.
}

settings {
  encodeUrl: true
}
